                            <comment id="498689" author="yujian" created="Tue, 28 Jul 2026 19:16:12 +0000">&lt;p&gt;Not yet, &lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=adilger" class="user-hover" rel="adilger"&gt;adilger&lt;/a&gt;. I'm trying to rebase and make the RHEL 10.2 server support patch series (&lt;a href="https://review.whamcloud.com/66456" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://review.whamcloud.com/66456&lt;/a&gt;) work first. &lt;/p&gt;</comment>
